<title>USA: Fannie Mae sets $50 mln REMIC 1996-44.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets $50 mln REMIC 1996-44.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal National Mortgage Corp (Fannie Mae or FNMA) said it issued $50 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC 1996-44, issued through Salomon Inc, is backed by various FNMA REMIC tranches, Fannie Mae said.</p>
<p>The issue has a settlement date of September 30, the agency said.</p>
<p>--N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
